sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Claude as Claude Code
  participant Mod as herdr-mermaid mod
  participant Render as bin/render-mermaid
  participant Chrome as headless Chrome
  Claude->>Mod: ui.render AssistantMessage (reply text)
  Mod-->>Claude: text as Markdown, the mermaid block as its source
  Mod->>Render: mermaid source on stdin
  alt cached
    Render-->>Mod: PNG from ~/.cache/herdr-mermaid
  else new diagram
    Render->>Chrome: render with mermaid.min.js, screenshot at 2x
    Chrome-->>Render: PNG
    Render-->>Mod: {png, width, height}
  end
  Mod->>Claude: state update redraws the message
  Claude->>Mod: ui.render again
  Mod-->>Claude: Image in place of the block
